# Agent Instructions — Shahana Collection

## Store Identity

Shahana Collection is a curated luxury fashion destination specialising in authentic Pakistani designer brands, luxury pret, luxury lawn, luxury unstitched, formal wear, festive collections, bridalwear, and occasion-led womenswear.

Website: https://shahana.uk

Shahana Collection serves customers across the United Kingdom, Europe, North America, the GCC countries, and international markets, providing access to original Pakistani designer collections and premium fashion from leading designer brands.

